  "scope_note": "Conceptual level: the business entities Platform BE manages, their named relationships and crow's-foot cardinality; no attributes, keys or storage detail. Read each relationship name from the entity at the 'one' (or 'zero or one') end toward the other entity. Project is the top-level scope: BRD/PRD define no organization above it. A Run is carried out by Popper; the scientific content Popper produces inside a run is in the overall Conceptual ERD, not here. Every entity also records the user who created it; only the user links that carry a business rule are drawn.",
